{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, chaotic multiplayer party brawler! Control a cute\u2014but dangerous\u2014jelly beast, grab soaps, slam or absorb your opponents, change colors to turn the tide, and fight your way to victory in ever-changing arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, Jump into player-made levels too\u2014create your own or tackle wild DIY maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/9a9ad70956665b96638f51d5a7a983c1.poster.avif?t=1773890174\" width=864 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/9a9ad70956665b96638f51d5a7a983c1.webm?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/9a9ad70956665b96638f51d5a7a983c1.mp4?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 This Is a Game About Picking Up Soap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic playground, soap is everything. Grab it off the ground, steal it from your friends\u2014no rules, just chaos. More soap means more power. Turn in your soap, climb the leaderboard, and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/d824ff8634fef5887c02376571c17b9f.poster.avif?t=1773890174\" width=680 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/d824ff8634fef5887c02376571c17b9f.webm?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Bubble Combat, Pure Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bubble is both shield and weapon. Same colors pull together, different colors bounce apart. Switch colors to steal soap, knock rivals off the arena, or escape at the last second</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/910d2659642467cf9e2a3a8a0747e0e1.poster.avif?t=1773890174\" width=680 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/910d2659642467cf9e2a3a8a0747e0e1.webm?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/910d2659642467cf9e2a3a8a0747e0e1.mp4?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Soap Does More</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap doesn\u2019t just make you bigger and stronger\u2014it comes with wild special effects. Blow enemies away, swap positions, or clutch-save yourself in a pinch. With 20+ unique soaps to discover, there\u2019s always a new trick waiting for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/5067bf70d9d43b4cbf51442652cdf630.poster.avif?t=1773890174\" width=680 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/5067bf70d9d43b4cbf51442652cdf630.webm?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/5067bf70d9d43b4cbf51442652cdf630.mp4?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Playground Full of Surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is unpredictable. Floors may collapse, or someone might be waiting in the bushes for an ambush. Stay sharp\u2014because anything can happen here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/05cd88115a60c3d0fe51d27ac82d1eb1.poster.avif?t=1773890174\" width=758 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/05cd88115a60c3d0fe51d27ac82d1eb1.webm?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/05cd88115a60c3d0fe51d27ac82d1eb1.mp4?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Local &amp; Online Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 6 players online, or gather 2\u20134 friends for local play\u2014perfect for parties and get-togethers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dorm room brawls with six friends? A weekend piled on the couch with family? Jelly Bubble is your go-to party pick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/ef0de27274200f72b0e3a959ced34a50.poster.avif?t=1773890174\" width=758 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/ef0de27274200f72b0e3a959ced34a50.webm?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/ef0de27274200f72b0e3a959ced34a50.mp4?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 DIY Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own custom maps and invite friends to battle through your wild creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/6c46dbba33857bdcdf85c527ed99ba20.poster.avif?t=1773890174\" width=864 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/6c46dbba33857bdcdf85c527ed99ba20.webm?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/6c46dbba33857bdcdf85c527ed99ba20.mp4?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2026And There\u2019s More on the Way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 4 competitive modes built around the core pull-and-bounce</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 16 unique maps, with more coming in future updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 20+ interactive stage hazards, ensuring every match plays out differently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Ongoing updates packed with more chaos, more laughs, and more surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/5003c427dd16679935f9c0ef104106a3.poster.avif?t=1773890174\" width=864 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/5003c427dd16679935f9c0ef104106a3.webm?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659090/extras/5003c427dd16679935f9c0ef104106a3.mp4?t=1773890174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. The party is only getting louder. \ud83c\udf89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/